<p class="status">HTTP 422</p>
<h1>Domain list is not sorted</h1>
<p class="code">DOMAINS_NOT_CANONICAL</p>
<h2>What this means</h2>
<p><code>domains</code> is unsorted or holds a duplicate. JCS orders object members but not array elements, so array order is signed as submitted; requiring one order makes the payload a deterministic function of the set.</p>
<h2>What to do</h2>
<p>Sort ascending by code point and deduplicate before signing.</p>
